        279.87469482421875,
        107.33880615234375,
        298.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "Okay.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        311.6110534667969,
        105.86299896240234,
        331.1124572753906
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        331.59368896484375,
        510.41534423828125,
        370.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "I don't have any information about their charges, so it's best to use their app\nto find out what it would cost you to use them.\n"
