        454.35345458984375
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        454.95367431640625,
        518.17724609375,
        513.4735717773438
      ],
      "text": "One good thing about that company is that if you don't like the furniture once\nit's delivered, you can request exchanges, as long as you do that within a week\nof receiving it.\n"
