    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        580.1710205078125,
        112.94929504394531,
        599.6724243164062
      ],
      "text": "PART 2\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        614.314697265625,
        526.8180541992188,
        752.2736206054688
      ],
      "text": "Hello, I'm Hayden. I'm one of the archaeologists investigating the site here at\nBidcaster. This is the third summer for this community project, and most of the\npeople digging here are volunteers. I'm a full-time archaeologist for the town\ncouncil, but I was asked to join the project by NHA, a charity which sets up\nprojects like this up and down the country. As you can see, we're next to\nBidcaster Castle, which is great because the owners let us use their facilities. So,\nhow did we get to where we are today?\n"
    }
